  columns \'97 ATG is in-vivo T-cell depletion that works through a different\
  mechanism than a calcineurin inhibitor backbone. The right home for it is a\
  \cf11 conditioning_atg\cf2  or similar conditioning-regimen column alongside the Bu/Cy/Flu\
  doses already in the source.\
