  \uc0\u8594  cni-mmf. CNI column: cyclosporine/tacrolimus from the respective indicator.\
  Sirolimus is constant "no" \uc0\u8594  confirm no partner is "other", but since everyone\
  has exactly one of MTX or MMF, this case never fires.\
