     \cf16 \cb17      +\cf10 n the binary columns below.                                     \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf16 \cb17  574 +\cf10 - `conditioning_tbi` \'97 binary `1`/`0`/`NA`, added to `binary_out\cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf16 \cb17      +\cf10 come_cols`                                                      \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf16 \cb17  575 +\cf10 - `conditioning_serotherapy` \'97 binary `1`/`0`/`NA` (ATG or anti-\cf2 \cb1 \
