     \cf16 \cb17  576 +\cf10                                                                 \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf16 \cb17  577 +\cf10 **Why.** Conditioning intensity is an established predictor of G\cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf16 \cb17      +\cf10 VHD and engraftment and a required covariate in competing-risks \cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf16 \cb17      +\cf10 analyses. TBI and serotherapy are independent predictors with se\cf2 \cb1 \
     \cf16 \cb17      +\cf10 parate biological mechanisms; separating them from the drug-toke\cf2 \cb1 \
